title: The Defence and Allied-Security Settlement
subtitle: Begin with a civilian-controlled settlement and European integration; an audited pipeline is a fallback, not a first rung.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_major_reform_card
frequency: 130
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_defence_reform_timer <= 0 and defence_reform_settled = 0 and defence_on_slate = 1 and reform_pressure_pending = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.poland_defence_reform_timer = 3;
Q.defence_reform_next_stage = Number(Q.defence_reform_proposal_stage) || 4;
const thresholds = [0, 22, 34, 50, 70];
Q.defence_reform_threshold = thresholds[Q.defence_reform_next_stage];
const ministryBonus =
    (Q.defence_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 12 : 0) +
    (Q.foreign_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 6 : 0) +
    (Q.economy_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 4 : 0);
const koCabinet = Q.government_party == "ko" || Q.ministry_ko_in_cabinet;
const pslCabinet = Q.government_party == "psl" || Q.ministry_psl_in_cabinet;
const p2050Cabinet =
    Q.government_party == "p2050" || Q.ministry_p2050_in_cabinet;
const thirdWayCabinet = pslCabinet || p2050Cabinet;
let partnerBonus = 0;
if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
    partnerBonus =
        Number(Q.pis_relation) * 0.14 +
        Number(Q.defence_pis_commitment) * 7 +
        Number(Q.pis_accept_order) * 0.10 - 10;
} else {
    partnerBonus =
        (koCabinet
            ? Number(Q.ko_relation) * 0.12 +
                Number(Q.ko_accept_order) * 0.10 +
                Number(Q.defence_ko_commitment) * 7
            : 0) +
        (thirdWayCabinet
            ? Number(Q.defence_third_way_commitment) * 5
            : 0);
}
const palaceBonus =
    Number(Q.president_relation) * 0.07 +
    (Q.defence_palace_president == Q.president_name
        ? Number(Q.defence_palace_commitment) * 6
        : 0);
const publicBonus =
    (Number(Q.national_security_support) - 45) * 0.35 +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_poll) - 5) * 0.45 -
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.national_security_backlash) - 50) * 0.10;
Q.defence_reform_power = Math.round(Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        140,
        Number(Q.defence_reform_progress) * 0.62 +
        partnerBonus + palaceBonus + publicBonus + ministryBonus
    )
));
Q.reform_ceiling_issue = "defence";
Q.reform_ceiling_target = Q.defence_reform_next_stage;
!}
call: poland_reform_ceiling
card-image: img/poland/cards/polish-dossier.webp

= Defence as a whole-game project

**Campaign goal:** [? if defence_reform_defined: [+ defence_reform_goal_label
+].?][? if not defence_reform_defined: Not yet defined.?]
[? if defence_reform_defined: **Bill currently on the table:** [+
defence_reform_next_label +].
**Passage power:** **[+ defence_reform_power +]**; tabling this bill needs **[+
defence_reform_threshold +]**.
**Settlement ceiling:** [+ reform_ceiling_tier_label +] — [+
reform_ceiling_reachable_label +].
[? if reform_ceiling_blocker_kind != "none": Binding veto player: **[+
reform_ceiling_blocker_name +]** — scores the bill [+
reform_ceiling_blocker_score +] against the [+ reform_ceiling_need +] a tier-[+
reform_ceiling_target_resolved +] settlement needs.?]
[+ reform_ceiling_breakdown +].?][? if not defence_reform_defined: The first
project action must define the ambitious bill before preparation or bargaining
can begin.?]

Nobody in Polish politics is against defence spending. The unclaimed ground is
what the money buys: audited procurement instead of announcement contracts,
domestic industrial capacity instead of imports, and veteran provision that
treats service as employment.

[? if government_party = "pis": PiS owns the spending and resists the audit.
Trading volume for accountability is the available bargain.?][? if government_party != "pis":
KO is the most enthusiastic partner on this field in the whole game — and the
most reluctant to write the industrial-policy clauses.?]

[? if defence_minister_party = "Lewica": Holding Defence turns a Left position
on this field from a curiosity into a governing programme.?]

- @define_goal
- @draft
- @coalition_round
- @cash_relation
- @ministry
- @palace
- @advance

@define_goal
title: Define the goal as civilian control, industry and allied integration
subtitle: Audit, domestic production, veteran provision and European integration enter as one demand.
view-if: defence_reform_defined = 0
on-arrival: defence_reform_defined = 1; defence_on_slate = 1; defence_reform_goal_stage = 4; defence_reform_proposal_stage = 4; defence_reform_next_stage = 4; defence_reform_progress += 12; government_delivery += 1; public_mood_pending_national_security_salience += 3; news_headline = "Lewica defines an audited, industrial defence settlement as its security bill"

A left defence policy that is not simply a smaller number is the version nobody
has had to argue against yet.

- #poland_card_finish

@draft
title: Keep the procurement auditors and industry drafting
subtitle: Free. Preparation +10.
view-if: defence_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: defence_reform_progress += 10; government_delivery += 1; news_headline = "Lewica keeps its defence-procurement statute ready for the next opening"

Auditors, shipyard and armaments managers and veterans' organisations produce a
pipeline with delivery dates rather than a press conference.

- #poland_card_finish

@coalition_round
title: Put the defence file on a partner's table
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Choose KO, [+ third_way_display_name +] or PiS and record one commitment.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A serious negotiating round needs one resource.
view-if: defence_reform_defined = 1
new-page: true

- @round_ko
- @round_third_way
- @round_pis

@round_ko
title: Ask KO to record a procurement-audit floor
on-arrival: resources -= 1; defence_reform_progress += 8; defence_ko_commitment += 1; ko_relation += 5; news_headline = "KO records a procurement-audit floor for the defence budget"

- #poland_card_finish

@round_third_way
title: Make [+ third_way_display_name +] name the domestic capacity it would fund
view-if: p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1
on-arrival: {! Q.resources -= 1; Q.defence_reform_progress += 8; Q.defence_third_way_commitment += 1; Q.psl_relation += 4; Q.p2050_relation += 4; Q.news_headline = Q.third_way_display_name + " records domestic defence-production commitments"; !}

- #poland_card_finish

@round_pis
title: Trade spending volume with PiS for procurement audit
choose-if: (left_in_government = 1 and government_party = "pis") or pis_relation >= 15 or national_crisis_pressure >= 20
unavailable-subtitle: PiS will not open the procurement books without coalition ties, a channel or national pressure.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; defence_reform_progress += 8; defence_pis_commitment += 1; pis_relation += 4; news_headline = "PiS trades procurement transparency for defence-budget support"

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_relation
title: Cash in a party relationship instead of spending a resource
subtitle: Choose a 55+ relationship; it falls by 10 and becomes one recorded commitment.
choose-if: ko_relation >= 55 or pis_relation >= 55 or ((p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1) and (psl_relation >= 55 or p2050_relation >= 55))
unavailable-subtitle: No potential governing partner trusts us enough yet.
view-if: defence_reform_defined = 1
new-page: true

- @cash_ko
- @cash_third_way
- @cash_pis

@cash_ko
title: Spend KO goodwill on the defence settlement
choose-if: ko_relation >= 55
on-arrival: ko_relation -= 10; defence_ko_commitment += 1; defence_reform_progress += 10; news_headline = "Lewica converts KO goodwill into defence-procurement reform"

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_third_way
title: Spend [+ third_way_display_name +] goodwill on defence industry
view-if: p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1
choose-if: psl_relation >= 55 or p2050_relation >= 55
on-arrival: {!
if (Number(Q.psl_relation) >= Number(Q.p2050_relation)) {
    Q.psl_relation -= 10;
} else {
    Q.p2050_relation -= 10;
}
Q.defence_third_way_commitment += 1;
Q.defence_reform_progress += 10;
Q.news_headline = "Lewica converts " + Q.third_way_display_name + " goodwill into defence industrial policy";
!}

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_pis
title: Spend PiS goodwill on procurement transparency
choose-if: pis_relation >= 55
on-arrival: pis_relation -= 10; defence_pis_commitment += 1; defence_reform_progress += 10; news_headline = "Lewica converts PiS goodwill into procurement transparency"

- #poland_card_finish

@ministry
title: Make the Defence Ministry produce the pipeline and audit file
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity. Preparation +14.
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and budget >= 1 and (defence_minister_party = "Lewica" or economy_minister_party = "Lewica")
unavailable-subtitle: Requires the Defence or Economy portfolio and one budget point.
view-if: defence_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; defence_reform_progress += 14; administrative_capacity += 2; government_delivery += 2; news_headline = "The Defence Ministry maps procurement, domestic capacity and veteran provision"

Contracts, delivery schedules and plant capacity acquire numbers. The audit
stops being an accusation and becomes a process.

- #poland_card_finish

@palace
title: Put the defence settlement before the President
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Presidential commitment +1; preparation +6.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Palace delegation needs one resource.
view-if: defence_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
if (Q.defence_palace_president != Q.president_name) {
    Q.defence_palace_commitment = 0;
    Q.defence_palace_president = Q.president_name;
}
Q.defence_palace_commitment += 1;
Q.defence_reform_progress += 6;
Q.president_relation += 4;
Q.news_headline = "The Palace receives the defence procurement and readiness file";
!}

This is the President's own office and the one file where the Palace is
usually an ally rather than an obstacle. That does not make the industrial
clauses free — it makes them negotiable.

- #poland_card_finish

@advance
title: Table the bill: [+ defence_reform_next_label +]
subtitle: Requires government and passage power at or above the displayed threshold; veto players may force a narrower final settlement.
view-if: defence_reform_defined = 1
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and defence_reform_power >= defence_reform_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: We either lack executive access or have not assembled enough coalition, public and presidential power.
on-arrival: reform_pressure_issue = "defence"; reform_pressure_target_stage = defence_reform_proposal_stage; reform_pressure_previous_stage = 0; reform_pressure_return_mode = "card"; reform_pressure_palace_override = 0; reform_pressure_referendum_used = 0
go-to: poland_major_reforms.resolve
